«
@@ ============================================================
@@ VincentyDir — point reached from a given point, azimuth and
@@ distance on the WGS-84 ellipsoid, the direct geodetic problem.
@@ T. Vincenty, Survey Review 23(176), 1975, pp. 88-93.
@@
@@ Input : φ1 λ1 α1 s — latitude and longitude of departure (East
@@         positive), initial azimuth from true North, distance.
@@         Plain numbers are degrees and metres; angles and lengths
@@         with a unit are accepted.
@@ Output: φ2 λ2 α2 — latitude and longitude reached, and azimuth
@@         there, in degrees.
@@ The iteration converges to 1E-12 radian; it always converges for
@@ the direct problem. Angle mode and angle units setting are
@@ restored before returning (see VincentyInv for why not IFERR).
@@ ============================================================

  IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_m CONVERT UVAL END
  → dist
  «
    3 →LIST
    « IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_r CONVERT UVAL ELSE Ⓒπ →Num * 180 / END »
    MAP LIST→ DROP dist
  »
  Ⓒa♁GPS →Num UVAL Ⓒf♁GPS →Num
  'AngleMode' RCL 'SetAngleUnits' RCL
  RAD NoAngleUnits
  → p1 q1 az1 dist axa fla amode aunits
  «
    'axa*(1-fla)' EVAL 'ATAN((1-fla)*TAN(p1))' EVAL
    → bxa ur1
    «
      ur1 SIN ur1 COS
      → su1 cu1
      «
        '(su1/cu1)∠(COS(az1))' EVAL
        'cu1*SIN(az1)' EVAL
        → sg1 salf
        «
          '1-salf²' EVAL
          → c2a
          «
            'c2a*(axa²-bxa²)/bxa²' EVAL
            → usq
            «
              '1+usq/16384*(4096+usq*(-768+usq*(320-175*usq)))' EVAL
              'usq/1024*(256+usq*(-128+usq*(74-47*usq)))' EVAL
              → aca bcb
              «
                'dist/(bxa*aca)' EVAL 0 0 0
                → sgm sgp c2m iter
                «
                  DO
                    sgm 'sgp' STO
                    'COS(2*sg1+sgm)' EVAL 'c2m' STO
                    'dist/(bxa*aca)+bcb*SIN(sgm)*(c2m+bcb/4*(COS(sgm)*(2*c2m²-1)-bcb/6*c2m*(4*SIN(sgm)²-3)*(4*c2m²-3)))' EVAL 'sgm' STO
                    iter 1 + 'iter' STO
                  UNTIL
                    'ABS(sgm-sgp)' EVAL 1E-12 < iter 200 ≥ OR
                  END
                  'COS(2*sg1+sgm)' EVAL 'c2m' STO
                  'su1*SIN(sgm)-cu1*COS(sgm)*COS(az1)' EVAL
                  'fla/16*c2a*(4+fla*(4-3*c2a))' EVAL
                  → tmp cvc
                  «
                    '(su1*COS(sgm)+cu1*SIN(sgm)*COS(az1))∠((1-fla)*√(salf²+tmp²))' EVAL
                    '(SIN(sgm)*SIN(az1))∠(cu1*COS(sgm)-su1*SIN(sgm)*COS(az1))' EVAL
                    → lat2 lamb
                    «
                      'q1+lamb-(1-cvc)*fla*salf*(sgm+cvc*SIN(sgm)*(c2m+cvc*COS(sgm)*(2*c2m²-1)))' EVAL
                      → lon2
                      «
                        lat2 180 * Ⓒπ →Num / 1_° *
                        '(SIN(lon2))∠(COS(lon2))' EVAL 180 * Ⓒπ →Num / 1_° *
                        '(salf)∠(-tmp)' EVAL 180 * Ⓒπ →Num / 360 MOD 1_° *
                      »
                    »
                  »
                »
              »
            »
          »
        »
      »
    »
    amode EVAL IF aunits THEN SetAngleUnits ELSE NoAngleUnits END
  »
»
